cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact or refer to these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "GenWebSec artifact: adaptive WAF hardening with co-evolving LLM attack and defense agents"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifacts for GenWebSec, an execution-grounded framework that couples a
  large-language-model attack agent with a large-language-model defense agent to harden a web
  application firewall against SQL-injection and cross-site-scripting attacks. The repository
  contains the per-seed, per-context experimental results, the generated ModSecurity rules, the
  redacted defense-agent prompts, and the scripts that regenerate the tables and figures reported in
  the paper. Attack-agent prompts and raw bypass payloads are intentionally withheld.
